:"Generic error during transcription."},minimum_transcript_length:{description:"The video has a transcript that is too short to be processed by this feature. Currently the limit is 150 characters, and this is enforced for all languages. This means denser languages by character length may require more more transcript to be available"},missing_screenshot:{description:"The screenshot could not be found, mostly likely it's been deleted before intelligence could be processed."},missing_user:{description:"The user could not be found, mostly likely something is down with the database preventing users from being fetched."},missing_video:{description:"The video could not be found, mostly likely it's been deleted or canceled before intelligence could be processed."},no_completion_time:{description:"The video has no known completion time, which means the timeout cannot be calculated."},no_response_stream:{description:"The LLM response has no response stream. This is most due to an outage on the LLM provider preventing a streaming connection from being set up."},failed_to_generate_value:{description:"The LLM did not generate the value for this feature, which alewys expect a value to be generated."},no_value_generated:{description:"The LLM did not generate any value for this feature. This is normal for this auto-context feature."},not_in_experiment:{description:"The user is not in the experiment for this particular feature."},timeout:{description:"Intelligence took too long to process. Preventing any intelligence from overriding the results on the video."},user_has_no_access:{description:"The user has no access to this feature. This is not an error, but rather the user is not eligible for this feature."},video_has_clips:{description:"The video has clips (v6) and is not eligible for this feature."},usage_limit:{description:"The user has used up their free AI Add On plan usage limit. This can be bumped in the admin console if needed"},user_edited:{description:"The feature was edit